new file mode 100644
index 0000000..f9e0dba
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/69900.added.md
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+Added a ``beacons.status`` execution module function that reports, per
+configured beacon, the epoch time it last fired and the error (if any)
+raised by that last run. A beacon that has not fired yet reports
+``last_fired`` and ``last_error`` as ``None`` rather than a stale or
+made-up value. Status is tracked live in the running minion process, so it
+requires no new probe cycle, no log parsing, and no minion restart.
